[OPTIONS]
  Units CMH
  Headloss H-W
  Accuracy 0.001
  Trials 200

[TITLE]
Pump at shutoff: the pump (shutoff head 13.33 m) lifts Supply (5 m) above the
High reservoir (17 m), so the junction must sit at the shutoff head (18.33 m)
with ~zero flow. The tiny bypass keeps the pump flow close to its barrier.

[JUNCTIONS]
; ID        Elevation  Demand
  Outlet    0          0

[RESERVOIRS]
; ID        Head
  Supply    5
  High      17

[PIPES]
; ID        From     To      Length  Diameter  Roughness  MinorLoss  Status
  Bypass    High     Outlet  1000    1         130        0          OPEN

[PUMPS]
; ID        From     To      Parameters
  Pump1     Supply   Outlet  HEAD C1

[CURVES]
; ID  Flow  Head
  C1  10    10

[TIMES]
  Duration 2:00
  Hydraulic Timestep 1:00
  Report Timestep 1:00

[COORDINATES]
Supply 0 0
Outlet 1 0
High 2 0

[END]
